Description: A modern R binding for 'DataTables' V2 with modular
    extension loading, 'Bootstrap 5' styling, 'Shiny' integration (proxy, events,
    inline inputs), server-side processing helpers, and standalone (non-Shiny)
    support. Configure 'DataTables' options directly via R lists, a 1:1 mapping
    to the 'JavaScript' API. 'DataTables' is developed by 'SpryMedia Ltd'
    <https://datatables.net>; this package is an independent binding, not
    affiliated with or endorsed by 'SpryMedia Ltd'.
Copyright: The R code and the 'htmlwidgets' binding are copyright of the
    package authors. The bundled 'JavaScript' and 'CSS' libraries in
    inst/htmlwidgets/lib ('DataTables' and its extensions, 'jQuery',
    'Bootstrap', 'pdfmake' with the 'Roboto' fonts, 'JSZip' and 'Moment.js')
    are copyright of their respective authors, listed with role 'cph' in
    Authors@R; see inst/COPYRIGHTS for versions, licenses and notices. The
    bundled 'pdfmake' build in turn embeds third-party components (among them
    'pdfkit', 'fontkit', 'core-js', 'crypto-js', 'iconv-lite' and 'pako'),
    whose copyright holders and licenses are listed in inst/COPYRIGHTS.
